WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.220
At first I was like, sweet,

00:00:01.221 --> 00:00:02.801
a portable AC fan!

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:06.440
And then I realized I made the biggest mistake buying it.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.460
And it's not because it gets super icy cold.

00:00:09.461 --> 00:00:12.741
It's certainly not because it has 199 fan speeds.

00:00:12.742 --> 00:00:14.421
Or because it can literally fold in half

00:00:14.422 --> 00:00:16.421
and I can set it on my desk when I'm working.

00:00:16.422 --> 00:00:18.961
Or because it comes with a lanyard and a stand.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.700
Mistake was that I paid full price for it

00:00:20.701 --> 00:00:22.261
and they just put it on a huge sale.

00:00:22.262 --> 00:00:23.541
And with summer right around the corner,

00:00:23.542 --> 00:00:25.741
we already know that that price is gonna go way back up.

00:00:25.742 --> 00:00:28.301
So I linked the one that's on a huge sale down below for you

00:00:28.302 --> 00:00:30.100
so you don't make the mistake that I made.
